OL,3,GNEWSAOtter's death sparks warning over
OL,4,Aillegal traps
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe growing use of illegal crayfish
OL,7,Ftraps has been criticised by
OL,8,Fenvironmental groups after an otter
OL,9,Fbecame trapped and died on a West
OL,10,FYorkshire canal.
OL,12,FThe dead otter was found in a crayfish
OL,13,Ftrap near a bridge on the
OL,14,FLeeds-Liverpool Canal in Silsden and
OL,15,Fthose responsible were currently
OL,16,Funknown, according to police.
OL,18,FThe Environment Agency said such traps
OL,19,Fwere an ongoing issue on waterways,
OL,20,Fwhile the Canal and River Trust said it
OL,21,Fwas "hugely concerning".
OL,23,APub: 18-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBYrk Lincs NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,383,380,200,160,0,100
