OL,3,GNEWSAOtter's death sparks warning over
OL,4,Aillegal traps
OL,5,
OL,6,FPhillippa Baron, senior ecologist at
OL,7,Fthe Canal & River Trust, said the
OL,8,Frecent return of otters to the River
OL,9,FAire and the Leeds & Liverpool Canal
OL,10,Fhad been an "environmental success
OL,11,Fstory" and it was "very sad" to hear of
OL,12,Fthe animal's death.
